\begin_layout Section
Familiarity Measurement with the Edit Distance
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
In order to generate solution candidates that are as familiar as possible,
 we need to define a distance function on a suitable unit of measurement
  which represents the scope of the change.
 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
The mandatory prerequisites for a distance measure are: 
\begin_inset CommandInset label
LatexCommand label
name "xaiMeasurementRequirements"

\end_inset


\end_layout

