\begin_layout Paragraph
Technische Umsetzung, Tensorflow enabled Evaluation xx
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
Fitness evaluation is the bottleneck of performance.
 Kai Staats has shown with KarooGP that a 2-15 times speedup can be achieved
 by converting expressions into Tensorflow graphs, which enables parallel
 evaluation on the GPU.
\begin_inset CommandInset citation
LatexCommand cite
key "karooGPpaper"
literal "true"

\end_inset

 To further enable pre-simplification of expressions, the python library
 Sympy
\begin_inset CommandInset citation
LatexCommand cite
key "10.7717/peerj-cs.103"
literal "true"

\end_inset

 was extended and integrated, which uses symbolic mathematics and thus sifts
 out unnecessary calculations before evaluation.
 [xx see error] The memory usage and performance could be further increased,
 largely thanks to the help of lookup-tables for tree evaluation, passing
 variables locally and especially using recursive tree structures.
\begin_inset Foot
status open

